<div id="block-omiclear-page-title" class="block block-core block-page-title-block">
  
    
      
  <h1 class="page-title"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">Types of participants</span>
</h1>


  </div>
<div id="block-omiclear-content" class="block block-system block-system-main-block">
  
    
      
<div class="node node--type-cc-content node--view-mode-full">

  
    
    <div class="node__content">
      
      <div class="field field--name-field-cc-section field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="section accordion-tabs clearfix ac-accordian field__item" data-title="false" data-subtitle="false" data-colors="default" style="margin-bottom:70px;" id="section-0">  <div class="center paragraph paragraph--type--accordion-tabs paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
      <div class="field field--name-field-cc-at field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="center paragraph paragraph--type--cc-accordion-item paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-cc-at-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Registration Agent</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-cc-at-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><ul>
	<li>Must sign an admission agreement with OMIClear (Form C34)&nbsp;<img alt="registration agent" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="59ff4ce7-c562-4caf-856a-7c68b815f5a2" height="171" src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/registration_agent_jpeg.jpg" width="290" class="align-right" loading="lazy"></li>
	<li>Has access to a trading platform with which OMIClear has an interconnection agreement, being capable to register trades in OMIClear for its clearing and settlement</li>
	<li>Also called “Non-Clearing Member” (NCM)</li>
	<li>Holds Registration Accounts to register the trades in OMIClear which must be connected to a Clearing Account of a Clearing Member (role assumed by the same entity or by a third party)</li>
	<li>2 possible categories:​​​​​​</li>
</ul>

<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1.&nbsp;Registration Agents for own account<br>
&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2.&nbsp;Registration Agents for Third Parties Account (brokers)</p></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="center paragraph paragraph--type--cc-accordion-item paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-cc-at-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Clearing Member</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-cc-at-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p><img alt="clearing member" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="c6e57c0a-dd65-46f6-a9f4-e52cde337c0c" height="178" src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/clearing_member_jpeg_1.jpg" width="299" class="align-right" loading="lazy"></p>

<ul>
	<li>Must sign an admission agreement with OMIClear (Form C04)&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>
	<li>Must fulfill on an ongoing basis the capital and risk level requisites defined by OMIClear</li>
	<li>Acts as the buy or sell counterparty of the positions registered in the CCP</li>
	<li>Is responsible to deposit guarantees in OMIClear to cover the required margins, clearing fund or other liabilities before the CCP</li>
	<li>Is responsible for the cash settlements of the registered positions at TARGET2 payment system:<br>
	&nbsp; 1. Directly - if the Clearing Member also acts as Financial Settlement Agent &nbsp;in OMIClear (which requisite is to be a participant of TARGET2 system)<br>
	&nbsp; 2.&nbsp;Indirectly - if the Clearing Member signs a financial agreement with a Financial Settlement Agent &nbsp;of OMIClear</li>
	<li>Holds Clearing Accounts that are connected to Registration Accounts (own or clients’ accounts). Positions and margins are calculated on a clearing account level</li>
</ul></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="center paragraph paragraph--type--cc-accordion-item paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-cc-at-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Financial Settlement Agent</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-cc-at-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p><img alt="settlement" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="a3e958d0-7e55-4e99-a28c-b8b954340b76" height="176" src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/fsa_jpeg.jpg" width="300" class="align-right" loading="lazy"></p>

<ul>
	<li>Must sign an admission agreement with OMIClear (Form C05)</li>
	<li>Participates in TARGET2 payment system</li>
	<li>Perform the cash settlements on own account or on behalf of Clearing Members with which it has signed a financial settlement agreement</li>
	<li>Holds Financial Settlement Accounts at OMIClear (one separate account for each Clearing Member for which it renders services)</li>
	<li>Authorizes OMIClear to make automatic debits and credits in its TARGET2 account</li>
</ul></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="center paragraph paragraph--type--cc-accordion-item paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-cc-at-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Power Physical Settlement Agent</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-cc-at-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p><img alt="psa power" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="eff98e5e-1959-4013-9c9b-0d32320475b4" height="179" src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/psapower_jpeg.jpg" width="303" class="align-right" loading="lazy"></p>

<ul>
	<li>Must sign an admission agreement with OMIClear (Form C06)</li>
	<li>Must be an agent of OMIE Power Spot Market</li>
	<li>Holds Power Physical Delivery Accounts at OMIClear (connected to specific “UCP” accounts at OMIE which are allocated to specific buying/selling units of the spot market)</li>
	<li>Perform the physical delivery (assuming buy/sell orders at OMIE spot market) for own account or on behalf of clients holding physical Power &nbsp;Registration Accounts with which it has signed a power physical settlement agreement</li>
	<li>Authorizes OMIClear to perform notifications of the power net positions under delivery registered in its Power Physical Delivery Account(s) to OMIE Power Spot Market</li>
</ul></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="center paragraph paragraph--type--cc-accordion-item paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-cc-at-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Natural Gas Physical Settlement Agent</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-cc-at-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p><img alt="psa gas" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="ebb98e93-2f1b-434b-aa5e-c91cefc81ff1" height="179" src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/psagas_jpeg.jpg" width="304" class="align-right" loading="lazy"></p>

<ul>
	<li>Must sign an admission agreement with OMIClear (Form C39)</li>
	<li>Must be an agent of Enagás GTS – network user with a balancing account at the PVB-ES (Spanish Virtual Trading Point)</li>
	<li>Holds Natural Gas Physical Delivery Accounts (linked to the balancing account held by the network user at the PVB-ES</li>
	<li>Provides services for own account or on behalf of clients holding physical Gas Registration Accounts, based on a gas physical settlement agreement.</li>
	<li>Authorizes OMIClear to perform notifications of the net positions in the ‘PVB-ES NG Physical Futures’ contracts under delivery in its Natural Gas Physical Delivery Account(s) to Enagás GTS (‘single sided nomination’)</li>
</ul></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
          </div>
  
      </div>
</div>
          </div>
  
    </div>
  </div>

  </div>

  </div>


        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
